  "description": "*The truth behind.. farm animals?*\n\nThe animals living on the farm of Sae-Min’s family are not what they seem. Although they put up an act of innocence in front of Sae-Min’s family, they are fully capable of deliberately committing horrifying acts. Told from the point of view of an extremely intelligent old cat, this is a thrilling tale of jealousy, manipulation, and murder.\n\n(Source: Manta)",
